:["ESTABLISHED:CMP_IMAGE_DIFF","INDICATOR:CMP_VISUAL_DIFF"]}],"reference_variants":[{"id":"J1","file":"D_roundtrip_amount_altered.pdf","truth":"ALTERED","result":"CONFIRMED_CHANGE","outcome":"TP"},{"id":"J2","file":"A_original.pdf","truth":"UNALTERED","result":"NO_INDICATORS_DETECTED","outcome":"TN"},{"id":"J3","file":"D_roundtrip_amount_altered.pdf","truth":"ALTERED","result":"CONFIRMED_CHANGE","outcome":"TP"},{"id":"J4","file":"C_roundtrip_name_altered.pdf","truth":"ALTERED","result":"CONFIRMED_CHANGE","outcome":"TP"},{"id":"J5","file":"A_original.pdf","truth":"UNALTERED","result":"NO_INDICATORS_DETECTED","outcome":"TN"},{"id":"J6","file":"D_roundtrip_amount_altered.pdf","truth":"ALTERED","result":"CONFIRMED_CHANGE","outcome":"TP"}],"unsupported":["**Proving a PDF→Word→PDF round trip.** Nothing in the output file reliably records it; only tool labels (informational) can hint at it. Without a trusted original, content changes made this way cannot be detected (scenarios C, D).","**Recovering history from a fully regenerated or rewritten PDF** (scenarios Fb, I): the history does not exist in the file. This is reported as *unavailable*, never as *no tampering*.","**Judging truth.** Neither a valid signature, a matching hash, a matching issuer record nor an absence of indicators shows that information in a document is true.","**OCR / text comparison of scans.** Scanned pages are compared only as rendered pictures (indicators), never as text.","**Double-JPEG / DCT-coefficient analysis, JPEG block-grid misalignment, resampling detection, clone-detection and machine-learning forgery detectors.** Not implemented; image checks are limited to those listed above.","**Online certificate revocation.** The app has no network permission. Revocation is evaluated only from CRL/OCSP data embedded in the file or the signature; otherwise it is reported *unknown*.","**Legacy `adbe.x509.rsa_sha1` signatures and algorithms the platform cannot process** are reported as *could not be verified*, not as valid or invalid.","**Trust lists used for PDFs in practice (Adobe AATL, EU trusted lists).** Only the device's certificate store (or a test CA in tests) is used, so legitimate signatures can show as *unknown root*.","**Encrypted PDFs.** Structure is examined; strings, metadata and streams are not. Reported as a limitation.","**Vertical or rotated text, and multi-column reading order,** in word reconstruction. Comparisons are consistent between two files extracted the same way but can differ across very different layouts.","**DOCX originals as visual references.** A .docx can be compared by text, entities and embedded pictures, not by rendered pages.","**Running on a physical device or emulator.** The APK is built and its UI is exercised by Robolectric tests, but no emulator was available in the build environment; `PdfRenderer` page rendering was not executed on Android (the visual-comparison algorithm itself is tested with a `pdftoppm` renderer)."]}
